<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch September producer prices rise 1.8 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Dutch September producer prices rise 1.8 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>VOORBURG, Netherlands 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dutch producer price index (PPI) for manufactured goods rose a provisional 0.9 percent in September from August, giving a 1.8 percent rise year-on-year, the Central Bureau of Statistics (CBS) said.  </p>
<p> DUTCH PRODUCER PRICES	   Sept 96     Aug 96    Sept 95</p>
<p> Index (base 1990)		102.8	101.9	101.0</p>
<p> Month-on-month pct change	0.9	  0.0	  0.2</p>
<p> Year-on-year pct change	  1.8	  1.1	  2.9</p>
<p> Subindex domestic prices     106.4	105.9	104.3</p>
<p> yr/yr pct change		   2.0	  1.7	  2.5</p>
<p> Subindex export prices	  99.9	 98.7	 98.4</p>
<p> yr/yr pct change		   1.5	  0.5	  3.0</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
